{
  "file": "module1",
  "page": 26,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        67.39069366455078,
        527.3954467773438,
        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "due to the lower risk of progression from infection to disease than in the other at-risk populations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.412353515625,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "listed above, in whom TPT was recommended. This was not based on direct evidence that TPT is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        93.79071807861328,
        527.3809814453125,
        108.23371887207031
      ],
      "text": "harmful but was rather an attempt to prioritize TPT for populations at the highest risk of progression",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        106.99073028564453,
        527.4232788085938,
        121.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "to disease. The recommendation was not intended to be construed as a blanket recommendation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.3887939453125,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "against any testing or treatment in these populations but rather for a case-by-case assessment of risk.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.980132102966309,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.583984375,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "Regrettably, the recommendation was often misinterpreted as meaning that diabetes, use of alcohol,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997149467468262,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        146.59071350097656,
        527.5211791992188,
        161.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "tobacco smoking and underweight were contraindications for TPT in individuals who were otherwise",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.996599197387695,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        159.7907257080078,
        527.4094848632812,
        174.2337188720703
      ],
      "text": "eligible. Thus, in 2024, the GDG reconsidered its position and replaced the recommendation with a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        172.99073791503906,
        527.5239868164062,
        187.43373107910156
      ],
      "text": "statement that no recommendation is possible for these subgroups, given the evidence. Trial evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971161842346191,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        184.9147491455078,
        524.3027954101562,
        200.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "(42) on TPT in people with diabetes is expected to become available for review in a few years’ time  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        207.8946075439453,
        527.4180297851562,
        222.3376007080078
      ],
      "text": "The GDG agreed that prioritization of groups according to their risk and the local and national context",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973518371582031,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        221.09474182128906,
        527.5926513671875,
        235.53773498535156
      ],
      "text": "would be acceptable to people with TBI and to stakeholders such as clinicians and programme",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        234.2947540283203,
        524.388916015625,
        248.7377471923828
      ],
      "text": "managers. It noted that the high risk for ongoing TB transmission in certain groups, such as front-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        247.49476623535156,
        527.236328125,
        261.9377746582031
      ],
      "text": "line health-care workers (including students), prisoners (and prison staff), immigrants from areas",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        260.6947021484375,
        527.3921508789062,
        275.1377868652344
      ],
      "text": "homeless people and people who use drugs,  with a higher TB burden than that in the host country,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        273.89459228515625,
        527.532958984375,
        288.3376159667969
      ],
      "text": "requires attention, so that the benefit of treatment is not compromised by subsequent reinfection. TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970561027526855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        287.0947265625,
        527.42236328125,
        301.5377502441406
      ],
      "text": "complements other preventive components of the programme for active TB case-finding, infection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.0186767578125,
        281.6098937988281,
        314.7377624511719
      ],
      "text": "(29) . control and early treatment of TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.37223052978516,
        325.16131591796875,
        269.74224853515625,
        343.43133544921875
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.13720703125,
        527.3814697265625,
        364.5802307128906
      ],
      "text": "In their normative and planning documents, national TB and HIV authorities and other stakeholders",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.33721923828125,
        527.3531494140625,
        377.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "should clearly define priority populations for PMTPT. The aim should be to provide lasting protection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.5372314453125,
        527.38330078125,
        390.9802551269531
      ],
      "text": "from progression to TB disease to a maximum number of individuals at risk, thus limiting continued",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.73724365234375,
        527.3978881835938,
        404.1802673339844
      ],
      "text": "transmission and reinfection and reducing TB incidence over time. People with HIV and household",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.937255859375,
        524.442138671875,
        417.3802795410156
      ],
      "text": "contacts were the primary targets for global action by Member States at the United Nations high-",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        414.8612060546875,
        527.4052734375,
        430.5802917480469
      ],
      "text": "(6,43) . The GDG stressed that the best available evidence should be  level meetings in 2018 and 2023",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.33721923828125,
        527.50048828125,
        443.7802429199219
      ],
      "text": "used to ensure that the benefits outweigh the risks to individuals in these groups and to make the best",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.979681968688965,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.5372009277344,
        527.4259643554688,
        456.980224609375
      ],
      "text": "possible use of resources, which could yield savings for the entire health-care system. Any additional",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.7372131347656,
        527.5344848632812,
        470.18023681640625
      ],
      "text": "resources necessary to implement the guidance should not be viewed as a barrier but should stimulate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964241981506348,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.93719482421875,
        527.4034423828125,
        483.3802185058594
      ],
      "text": "programmatic mobilization of more funding. The GDG noted the value of ART in preventing TB in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.8612060546875,
        510.0867004394531,
        496.5802307128906
      ],
      "text": "(44) people with HIV and urged countries to ensure universal access to ART, as per WHO policy  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        503.8411865234375,
        527.4235229492188,
        518.2841796875
      ],
      "text": "Provision of TPT for people with HIV should be a core component of the HIV package of care and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        517.0411376953125,
        527.4112548828125,
        531.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "should be the responsibility primarily of national HIV/AIDS programmes and HIV service providers",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        528.965087890625,
        527.3864135742188,
        544.68408203125
      ],
      "text": "(44,45) . Some household contacts and other people eligible for TPT (e.g. people receiving dialysis,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        543.4411010742188,
        527.4257202148438,
        557.8840942382812
      ],
      "text": "prisoners) will also be HIV positive and would therefore require individual attention to minimize the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        556.64111328125,
        527.41357421875,
        571.0841064453125
      ],
      "text": "likelihood of developing TB disease. Care should be coordinated with the health services responsible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        569.8411865234375,
        527.4365234375,
        584.2841796875
      ],
      "text": "for TB. TPT should be viewed as one of a comprehensive set of interventions. Among people with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        583.0411376953125,
        527.4442749023438,
        597.484130859375
      ],
      "text": "HIV who were treated for TB in the past, TPT should be prioritized for adults and adolescents who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        596.2410888671875,
        206.2783203125,
        610.68408203125
      ],
      "text": "have been re-exposed to TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        617.945068359375,
        527.3948974609375,
        632.3880615234375
      ],
      "text": "In addition to HIV care, nutrition supplementation has been shown to reduce the risk of TB disease",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        629.869140625,
        364.01318359375,
        645.588134765625
      ],
      "text": "(46) by 39–48% in household contacts who are undernourished  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        652.8489990234375,
        527.4579467773438,
        667.2919921875
      ],
      "text": "Confirmation of TBI with either IGRA or skin testing and reliable exclusion of TB disease with sensitive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        666.0490112304688,
        527.4490966796875,
        680.4920043945312
      ],
      "text": "tests such as CXR are desirable before starting TPT. If these tests are not available, TPT should not be",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        679.2490234375,
        472.5861511230469,
        693.6920166015625
      ],
      "text": "withheld from eligible people if TB disease has been excluded on clinical grounds alone (see",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975522994995117,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        472.2768859863281,
        679.2490234375,
        519.1465454101562,
        693.6920166015625
      ],
      "text": "section 1.2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975522994995117,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        519.0355224609375,
        679.2490234375,
        524.4080810546875,
        693.6920166015625
      ],
      "text": ").",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.975522994995117,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        699.6768798828125,
        527.4310302734375,
        715.3958740234375
      ],
      "text": "(47,48) Identification of populations for TBI testing and TPT raises various ethical issues  . First, as TBI",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        714.1528930664062,
        527.6128540039062,
        728.5958862304688
      ],
      "text": "is an asymptomatic, non-contagious state, the ethical obligations are different from those for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        727.35302734375,
        527.4396362304688,
        741.7960205078125
      ],
      "text": "disease. For example, in the absence of an immediate risk of transmission, it would be unethical to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        740.5530395507812,
        527.4102783203125,
        754.9960327148438
      ],
      "text": "restrict the movement of a person with TBI who refuses treatment. Lack of evidence of the benefit",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86620330810547,
        753.7529296875,
        527.2741088867188,
        768.1959228515625
      ],
      "text": "of systematic testing and treatment in certain populations (e.g. people with diabetes or who are",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        43.29376983642578,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "8 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43409729003906,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.05807495117188,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06536865234375,
        801.0170288085938,
        390.6751403808594,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: tuberculosis preventive treatment, second edition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
